WEBVTT

00:02:29.346 --> 00:02:30.976
and that's incredibly important.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.976
During the hurricane,

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.314
you had MSNBC posting
about the hurricane on their blog,

00:02:36.338 --> 00:02:37.680
updating it frequently.

00:02:37.704 --> 00:02:40.976
This was possible because of the easy
nature of blogging tools.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.715
You have my friend,

00:02:42.739 --> 00:02:47.274
who has a blog on PVRs,
personal recorders.

00:02:47.298 --> 00:02:49.568
He makes enough money just by running ads,

00:02:49.592 --> 00:02:51.409
to support his family up in Oregon.

00:02:51.433 --> 00:02:52.584
That's all he does now,

00:02:52.608 --> 00:02:55.050
and this is something
that blogs have made possible.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.858
And then you have something
like this, which is Interplast.

00:02:57.882 --> 00:02:59.460
It's a wonderful organization

00:02:59.484 --> 00:03:03.669
of people and doctors
who go to developing nations